{"assets":["/statement-assets/155c13340d386ddca873964011907283db23e40db25fbf9b0fc719aa34ed0fc7.png","/statement-assets/ec0b0b271386a3da4e74664848ecae4449b04575636e78c12f5fd29acb32a420.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"883","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"F. Lost in Transliteration"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"3 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"There are some ambiguities when one writes Berland names with the letters of the Latin alphabet."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For example, the Berland sound "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"u"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" can be written in the Latin alphabet as \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"u"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", and can be written as \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"oo"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\". For this reason, two words \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"ulyana"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" and \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"oolyana"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" denote the same name."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second ambiguity is about the Berland sound "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"h"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":": one can use both \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"h"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" and \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"kh"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" to write it. For example, the words \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"mihail"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" and \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"mikhail"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" denote the same name."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"There are "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" users registered on the Polycarp's website. Each of them indicated a name represented by the Latin letters. How many distinct names are there among them, if two ambiguities described above are taken into account?"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Formally, we assume that two words denote the same name, if using the replacements \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"u"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/155c13340d386ddca873964011907283db23e40db25fbf9b0fc719aa34ed0fc7.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":" \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"oo"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" and \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"h"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/155c13340d386ddca873964011907283db23e40db25fbf9b0fc719aa34ed0fc7.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":" \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"kh"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", you can make the words equal. One can make replacements in both directions, in any of the two words an arbitrary number of times. A letter that resulted from the previous replacement can participate in the next replacements."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For example, the following pairs of words denote the same name:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"koouper"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" and \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"kuooper"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\". Making the replacements described above, you can make both words to be equal: \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"koouper"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/ec0b0b271386a3da4e74664848ecae4449b04575636e78c12f5fd29acb32a420.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":" \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"kuuper"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" and \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"kuooper"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/ec0b0b271386a3da4e74664848ecae4449b04575636e78c12f5fd29acb32a420.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":" \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"kuuper"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\". "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"khun"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" and \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"kkkhoon"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\". With the replacements described above you can make both words to be equal: \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"khun"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/ec0b0b271386a3da4e74664848ecae4449b04575636e78c12f5fd29acb32a420.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":" \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"khoon"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" and \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"kkkhoon"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/ec0b0b271386a3da4e74664848ecae4449b04575636e78c12f5fd29acb32a420.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":" \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"kkhoon"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/s